    "Continue":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"et":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jätka"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ادامه"}},"fi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jatka"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pokračovat"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fortsæt"}},"el":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Συνέχεια"}},"bg":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Продължи"}},"bn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"চালিয়ে যান"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continua"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continue"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"متابعة"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"继续"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Weiter"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuer"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"जारी रखें"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"続ける"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuar"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Продолжить"}},"es-MX":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuar"}},"es-ES":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuar"}}}},
    "Couldn't prepare audio for speech. Check your audio settings and try again.":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"et":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Heli ei saanud kõneks ette valmistada. Kontrolli heliseadeid ja proovi uuesti."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"آماده‌سازی صدا برای گفتار ممکن نشد. تنظیمات صدا را بررسی و دوباره امتحان کنید."}},"fi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Äänen valmistelu puhetta varten epäonnistui. Tarkista ääniasetukset ja yritä uudelleen."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zvuk pro předčítání se nepodařilo připravit. Zkontrolujte nastavení zvuku a zkuste to znovu."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lyden til oplæsning kunne ikke klargøres. Kontrollér lydindstillingerne, og prøv igen."}},"el":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Δεν ήταν δυνατή η προετοιμασία ήχου για ομιλία. Ελέγξτε τις ρυθμίσεις ήχου και δοκιμάστε ξανά."}},"bg":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Не можа да се подготви аудио за реч. Проверете аудио настройките си и опитайте отново."}},"bn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"বক্তৃতার জন্য অডিও প্রস্তুত করা যায়নি। আপনার অডিও সেটিংস চেক করুন এবং আবার চেষ্টা করুন।"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No s'ha pogut preparar l'àudio per a la parla. Comprova la teva configuració d'àudio i torna-ho a provar."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Couldn't prepare audio for speech. Check your audio settings and try again."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تعذر تجهيز الصوت للنطق. تحقق من إعدادات الصوت وحاول مرة أخرى."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法准备语音播放。请检查音频设置后重试。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Audio für die Sprachausgabe konnte nicht vorbereitet werden. Prüfe deine Audioeinstellungen und versuche es erneut."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impossible de préparer l’audio pour la synthèse vocale. Vérifiez vos réglages audio et réessayez."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"बोलने के लिए ऑडियो तैयार नहीं किया जा सका। अपनी ऑडियो सेटिंग्स जांचें और फिर से कोशिश करें।"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"読み上げ用の音声を準備できませんでした。オーディオ設定を確認して、もう一度お試しください。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Não foi possível preparar o áudio para a fala. Verifique os ajustes de áudio e tente novamente."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Не удалось подготовить звук для озвучивания. Проверьте настройки аудио и попробуйте снова."}},"es-MX":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No se pudo preparar el audio para la voz. Revisa la configuración de audio e inténtalo de nuevo."}},"es-ES":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No se pudo preparar el audio para la voz. Revisa la configuración de audio e inténtalo de nuevo."}}}},
