    "Nibomo can send study reminders with a card from your review queue. These notifications contain study cards only and never marketing messages.":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"et":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo saab saata õppimise meeldetuletusi koos kaardiga sinu kordamisjärjekorrast. Need teavitused sisaldavad ainult õpikaarte, mitte kunagi turundussõnumeid."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo می‌تواند یادآورهای مطالعه را با کارتی از صف مرور شما بفرستد. این اعلان‌ها فقط کارت‌های مطالعه دارند و هرگز شامل پیام‌های تبلیغاتی نیستند."}},"fi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo voi lähettää opiskelumuistutuksia, joissa on kortti kertausjonostasi. Nämä ilmoitukset sisältävät vain opiskelukortteja eivätkä koskaan markkinointiviestejä."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo může posílat připomínky učení s kartičkou z vaší fronty opakování. Tato oznámení obsahují pouze kartičky k učení, nikdy reklamní zprávy."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo kan sende læringspåmindelser med et kort fra din repetitionskø. Disse notifikationer indeholder kun læringskort og aldrig reklamebeskeder."}},"el":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Το Nibomo μπορεί να στέλνει υπενθυμίσεις μελέτης με μια κάρτα από την ουρά επαναλήψεών σας. Αυτές οι γνωστοποιήσεις περιέχουν μόνο κάρτες μελέτης και ποτέ διαφημιστικά μηνύματα."}},"bg":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo може да изпраща напомняния за обучение с карта от опашката ви за преговор. Тези известия съдържат само учебни карти и никога маркетингови съобщения."}},"bn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo আপনার পুনরালোচনা সারি থেকে একটি কার্ড সহ অধ্যয়নের অনুস্মারক পাঠাতে পারে। এই বিজ্ঞপ্তিগুলিতে শুধুমাত্র স্টাডি কার্ড থাকে এবং কখনও বিপণনের বার্তা থাকে না।"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo pot enviar recordatoris d'estudi amb una targeta de la vostra cua de repàs. Aquestes notificacions només contenen targetes d'estudi i mai missatges de màrqueting."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo can send study reminders with a card from your review queue. These notifications contain study cards only and never marketing messages."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يمكن لتطبيق Nibomo إرسال تذكيرات بالدراسة مع بطاقة من قائمة المراجعة لديك. تحتوي هذه الإشعارات على بطاقات دراسية فقط ولا تتضمن رسائل تسويقية مطلقًا."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo 可以从你的复习队列中选取卡片向你发送学习提醒。这些通知仅包含学习卡片，绝不会包含营销消息。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo kann dir Lern-Erinnerungen mit einer Karte aus deiner Wiederholungswarteschlange senden. Diese Benachrichtigungen enthalten nur Lernkarten und niemals Marketingnachrichten."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo peut envoyer des rappels d’apprentissage avec une carte de votre file de révision. Ces notifications ne contiennent que des cartes d’apprentissage, jamais de messages marketing."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo आपकी समीक्षा कतार से एक कार्ड के साथ अध्ययन रिमाइंडर भेज सकता है। इन सूचनाओं में केवल अध्ययन कार्ड होते हैं, कभी भी मार्केटिंग संदेश नहीं।"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo は、復習キューのカードを使った学習リマインダーを送信できます。これらの通知には学習カードのみが含まれ、マーケティングメッセージは含まれません。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O Nibomo pode enviar lembretes de estudo com um cartão da sua fila de revisão. Essas notificações contêm apenas cartões de estudo e nunca mensagens promocionais."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo может отправлять напоминания об учебе с карточкой из вашей очереди повторения. Эти уведомления содержат только учебные карточки и никогда не содержат маркетинговых сообщений."}},"es-MX":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo puede enviarte recordatorios de estudio con una tarjeta de tu cola de repaso. Estas notificaciones solo contienen tarjetas de estudio y nunca mensajes promocionales."}},"es-ES":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nibomo puede enviarte recordatorios de estudio con una tarjeta de tu cola de repaso. Estas notificaciones solo contienen tarjetas de estudio y nunca mensajes promocionales."}}}},
    "Formula couldn't be rendered. Check the LaTeX syntax.":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"et":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Valemit ei saanud kuvada. Kontrolli LaTeXi süntaksit."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نمایش فرمول ممکن نشد. دستور نگارش LaTeX را بررسی کنید."}},"fi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kaavaa ei voitu näyttää. Tarkista LaTeX-syntaksi."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vzorec se nepodařilo vykreslit. Zkontrolujte syntaxi LaTeX."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formlen kunne ikke vises. Kontrollér LaTeX-syntaksen."}},"el":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Δεν ήταν δυνατή η απόδοση του τύπου. Ελέγξτε τη σύνταξη LaTeX."}},"bg":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Формулата не можа да бъде изобразена. Проверете синтаксиса на LaTeX."}},"bn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"সূত্র রেন্ডার করা যায়নি। LaTeX সিনট্যাক্স পরীক্ষা করুন।"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No s'ha pogut representar la fórmula. Comproveu la sintaxi de LaTeX."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Formula couldn't be rendered. Check the LaTeX syntax."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تعذر عرض الصيغة. تحقق من صياغة LaTeX."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法渲染公式。请检查 LaTeX 语法。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Formel konnte nicht dargestellt werden. Prüfe die LaTeX-Syntax."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impossible d’afficher la formule. Vérifiez la syntaxe LaTeX."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सूत्र रेंडर नहीं किया जा सका। LaTeX सिंटैक्स जांचें।"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"数式を表示できませんでした。LaTeX の構文を確認してください。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Não foi possível renderizar a fórmula. Verifique a sintaxe LaTeX."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Не удалось отобразить формулу. Проверьте синтаксис LaTeX."}},"es-MX":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No se pudo mostrar la fórmula. Revisa la sintaxis de LaTeX."}},"es-ES":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No se pudo mostrar la fórmula. Revisa la sintaxis de LaTeX."}}}},
    "Front":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"et":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Esikülg"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"روی کارت"}},"fi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Etupuoli"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Přední strana"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Forside"}},"el":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Μπροστινή πλευρά"}},"bg":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Лице"}},"bn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"সামনের দিক"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anvers"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Front"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"الوجه الأمامي"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正面"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vorderseite"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Recto"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सामने"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"表面"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Frente"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Лицевая сторона"}},"es-MX":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Frente"}},"es-ES":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anverso"}}}},
    "Good":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"et":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hea"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"خوب"}},"fi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hyvä"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dobré"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Godt"}},"el":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Καλό"}},"bg":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Добре"}},"bn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ভালো"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bé"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Good"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"جيد"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"良好"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gut"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Correct"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"अच्छा"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"良い"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bom"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Хорошо"}},"es-MX":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bien"}},"es-ES":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bien"}}}},
    "Hard":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"et":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Raske"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"سخت"}},"fi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vaikea"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Těžké"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Svært"}},"el":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Δύσκολο"}},"bg":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Трудно"}},"bn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"কঠিন"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Difícil"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hard"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"صعب"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"困难"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Schwer"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Difficile"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"कठिन"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"難しい"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Difícil"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Трудно"}},"es-MX":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Difícil"}},"es-ES":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Difícil"}}}},
    "Hard is for difficult recall":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"et":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"„Raske” tähendab vaevalist meenutamist"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"«سخت» برای یادآوری دشوار است"}},"fi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vaikea tarkoittaa vaikeaa muistamista"}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Těžké je pro obtížné vybavení odpovědi"}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Svært er til svar, der var svære at huske"}},"el":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Το Δύσκολο είναι για δύσκολη ανάκληση"}},"bg":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"„Трудно“ е за отговори, които си спомняте с усилие"}},"bn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"উত্তর মনে করতে কষ্ট হলে কঠিন বেছে নিন"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Difícil és per a quan costa recordar"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hard is for difficult recall"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يُستخدم \"صعب\" عندما يكون التذكر صعبًا"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"“困难”用于回忆起来较吃力的情况"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"\"Schwer\" ist für Fälle, in denen dir das Erinnern schwerfiel"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"« Difficile » sert en cas de rappel difficile"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"\"कठिन\" उस स्थिति के लिए है जब याद करना मुश्किल हो"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"「難しい」は思い出すのに苦労した場合に使います"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"\"Difícil\" é para quando custou lembrar"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"«Трудно» — для случаев, когда вспоминать было трудно"}},"es-MX":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"\"Difícil\" es para cuando te costó recordar"}},"es-ES":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"\"Difícil\" es para cuando te costó recordar"}}}},
    "If you did not know the answer, choose \"Again\". \"Hard\" is only for answers you knew but it was difficult to recall.":{"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"et":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kui sa vastust ei teadnud, vali „Uuesti”. „Raske” on ainult vastustele, mida teadsid, kuid mida oli raske meenutada."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"اگر پاسخ را نمی‌دانستید، «دوباره» را انتخاب کنید. «سخت» فقط برای پاسخ‌هایی است که می‌دانستید اما یادآوری‌شان دشوار بود."}},"fi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jos et tiennyt vastausta, valitse ”Uudelleen”. ”Vaikea” on vain vastauksille, jotka tiesit mutta joita oli vaikea muistaa."}},"cs":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pokud jste odpověď neznali, zvolte „Znovu“. „Těžké“ je pouze pro odpovědi, které jste znali, ale obtížně si je vybavovali."}},"da":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hvis du ikke kendte svaret, skal du vælge \"Igen\". \"Svært\" er kun til svar, du kendte, men havde svært ved at huske."}},"el":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Αν δεν γνωρίζατε την απάντηση, επιλέξτε «Ξανά». Το «Δύσκολο» είναι μόνο για απαντήσεις που γνωρίζατε αλλά δυσκολευτήκατε να θυμηθείτε."}},"bg":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ако не сте знаели отговора, изберете „Отново“. „Трудно“ е само за отговори, които сте знаели, но ви е било трудно да си спомните."}},"bn":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"উত্তর না জানলে আবার বেছে নিন। উত্তর জানা ছিল, কিন্তু মনে করতে কষ্ট হয়েছে—শুধু সে ক্ষেত্রেই কঠিন বেছে নিন।"}},"ca":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Si no sabies la resposta, tria «Un altre cop». «Difícil» només és per a respostes que sabies però que t’ha costat recordar."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"If you did not know the answer, choose \"Again\". \"Hard\" is only for answers you knew but it was difficult to recall."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"إذا لم تكن تعرف الإجابة، فاختر \"مرة أخرى\". يُستخدم \"صعب\" فقط للإجابات التي عرفتها لكن كان تذكرها صعبًا."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"如果你不知道答案，请选择“重来”。“困难”仅适用于你知道答案但回忆起来很吃力的情况。"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wenn du die Antwort nicht wusstest, wähle \"Nochmal\". \"Schwer\" ist nur für Antworten gedacht, die du wusstest, aber nur schwer abrufen konntest."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Si vous ne connaissiez pas la réponse, choisissez « À revoir ». « Difficile » est réservé aux réponses que vous connaissiez mais que vous avez eu du mal à retrouver."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"अगर आपको उत्तर नहीं पता था, तो \"फिर से\" चुनें। \"कठिन\" केवल उन उत्तरों के लिए है जिन्हें आप जानते थे, लेकिन याद करना मुश्किल था।"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"答えがわからなかった場合は「もう一度」を選んでください。「難しい」は、答えは知っていたものの思い出すのに苦労した場合にのみ使います。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Se você não sabia a resposta, escolha \"De novo\". \"Difícil\" é só para respostas que você sabia, mas custou lembrar."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Если вы не знали ответ, выберите «Снова». «Трудно» подходит только для ответов, которые вы знали, но их было трудно вспомнить."}},"es-MX":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Si no sabías la respuesta, elige \"Otra vez\". \"Difícil\" es solo para respuestas que sí sabías pero te costó recordarlas."}},"es-ES":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Si no sabías la respuesta, elige \"Otra vez\". \"Difícil\" es solo para respuestas que sí sabías pero te costó recordarla."}}}},
